# The system's tools as processes (design 11.2.4), for tools/ui_run.py: 屑実身操作,
# 実身/仮身検索, 仮身ネットワーク and ウインドウ一覧, each a program of its own. Each window
# stands for the tool's program object and opens where the desktop's own tool opened.
# Run again while open, a tool is brought to the front in the one window it has.
# Keys: Ctrl+E 08 01, Enter 28, Delete 4C, Ctrl+A 04 01, Ctrl+G 0A 01, Ctrl+N 11 01.
waitwin 原紙箱
#
# ---- 屑実身操作: a process, its list made by it
logmark
open 01a0d6d1-08d6-7896-adb0-7469517f6b4b
waitwin 屑実身操作 30
expectsince trash: up
expectsince trash: told of changes (0)
expectsince trash: opened 屑実身操作
win 屑実身操作
want ok 140 100 740 600
# run again: the one window to the front, its list made again
logmark
open 01a0d6d1-08d6-7896-adb0-7469517f6b4b
expectsince trash: run again
nwin 屑実身操作
want ok 1
# a program deleted: its program object becomes a 屑実身, and so does its
# template, taken out of the 原紙箱; the list is told, and has the two
logmark
progrm 01a0f638-4c5a-78a9-9bbd-adfbafa3466a
want ok 0
expectsince dtprog: template 0 of mpeg-player taken out of the 原紙箱 (0)
expectsince trash: told to make the list again
wait 800
shot st_trash
# everything taken and deleted for good, once agreed to
logmark
click 400 400
key 04 01
key 4C
expectsince trash: ask panel open
wait 600
shot st_trash_ask
key 28
expectsince trash: ask panel answered yes
# MPEG Player's program object is the administrator's: the desktop asks for the
# administrator's password, which the disk does not have yet (chosen, typed twice)
wait 1000
shot st_trash_admin
text ktest-admin
key 2b
text ktest-admin
wait 300
key 28
expectsince the administrator's password was set
expectsince trash: purge (
expectsince trash: purged 2 of 2
expectsince trash: 0 objects
refs 01a0f638-4c5a-78a9-9bbd-adfbafa3466a
want ok -1
logmark
key 08 01
expectsince trash: closed
#
# ---- ウインドウ一覧: the windows, asked of the desktop
logmark
open 01a0d8c4-52e2-7c63-9d74-e8f9a0b1c2d3
waitwin ウインドウ一覧 30
expectsince winlist: up
expectsince winlist: told of changes (0)
win ウインドウ一覧
want ok 700 80 1000 440
wait 800
shot st_winlist
# another window opened: the list made again with it
logmark
open 01a0d8c4-5b92-7c53-8d64-9fab0c1d5b92
waitwin 原紙集め 30
expectsince winlist: 4 windows
wait 800
shot st_winlist2
logmark
key 08 01
expectsince basecol: closed
expectsince winlist: 3 windows
logmark
open 01a0d8c4-52e2-7c63-9d74-e8f9a0b1c2d3
nwin ウインドウ一覧
want ok 1
#
# ---- 実身/仮身検索: asked first, the window with what answered
logmark
open 01a0d6d1-08d7-75a5-aac9-341907329044
expectsince search: search panel open
wait 600
shot st_search_ask
text TADjs
key 28
expectsince search: search panel answered
expectsince search: objects answered
expectsince search: up
wait 800
shot st_search
# 再検索 by running it again: the panel over the window, put away
logmark
open 01a0d6d1-08d7-75a5-aac9-341907329044
expectsince search: run again
expectsince search: search panel open
key 29
expectsince search: search panel put away
nwin 検索結果「TADjs」 16件
want ok 1
#
# ---- 仮身ネットワーク: from TADjsについて of the BTRON window, by 実身操作 > 仮身ネットワーク.
# The window at 80,60, its work area from 90,89; the first column at 130, the next at 430
logmark
click 80 87 1
wait 600
move 90 220
wait 150
move 100 227
wait 300
move 200 227
wait 150
move 240 327
wait 300
click 240 327
expectsince network: up
expectsince network: told of changes (0)
expectsince network: 18 objects 17 links as columns
nwin 仮身ネットワーク: TADjsについて
want ok 1
win 仮身ネットワーク: TADjsについて
want ok 80 60 980 660
wait 800
shot st_network
# the lines bent at right angles, no arrowheads: the upright of TADjsについて's links stands
# halfway between its right edge (330) and the left edge of the next column (430), at 380
pixel 380 300 000000
pixelnot 372 300 000000
pixelnot 388 300 000000
pixelnot 420 300 000000
# Ctrl+G and Ctrl+N: the graph, and the columns again, in the same window
logmark
key 0A 01
expectsince network: 18 objects 17 links as a graph
nwin 仮身グラフ: TADjsについて
want ok 1
wait 800
shot st_graph
logmark
key 11 01
expectsince network: 18 objects 17 links as columns
# its program run by itself: it starts only from a link, and the window stays the one
open 01a0d6d1-08d8-7fad-953e-8efd87b6fdb2
wait 500
nwin 仮身ネットワーク: TADjsについて
want ok 1
logmark
key 08 01
expectsince network: closed
absent !OACV!
